<title>FRANCE: Pechiney falls on profit warning.</title>
<headline>Pechiney falls on profit warning.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in aluminium group Pechiney fell 2.21 percent at the opening after the group issued a profit warning on Wednesday evening.</p>
<p>Pechiney said tha a fall in aluminium prices on the London Metal Exchange would lead to a difficult fourth quarter and the second half net result was likely to be a loss.</p>
<p>At 0913 GMT, Pechiney was down 2.21 percent at 217.10 francs. It had hit a low of 216.00 francs.</p>
</text>
